### Create a new subject
POST {{url}}/subjects
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Mathematics",
    "numberOfQuestions": 10
}

###
### Get all subjects
GET {{url}}/subjects

###
### Get subject by ID
GET {{url}}/subjects/1

###
### Update subject
PUT {{url}}/subjects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Advanced Mathematics",
    "numberOfQuestions": 15
}

###
### Delete subject
DELETE {{url}}/subjects/1


### =========================
### Questions
### =========================

###
### Create a new question for subject 1
POST {{url}}/subjects/1/questions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "What is 2 + 2?"
}

###
### Get all questions
GET {{url}}/questions

###
### Get question by ID
GET {{url}}/questions/1

###
### Update question
PUT {{url}}/questions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "What is 5 + 5?"
}

###
### Delete question
DELETE {{url}}/questions/1

```http
### Test AI-chatten
POST {{url}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "contents": [
        {
            "role": "user",
            "parts": [
                {
                    "text": "Forklar hvad en Java-klasse er. Svar på dansk og på begynderniveau."
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Test opfølgende spørgsmål med samtalehistorik
POST {{url}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "contents": [
        {
            "role": "user",
            "parts": [
                {
                    "text": "Hvad er en Java-klasse?"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "role": "model",
            "parts": [
                {
                    "text": "En Java-klasse er en skabelon, som bruges til at oprette objekter."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "role": "user",
            "parts": [
                {
                    "text": "Kan du give mig et eksempel?"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}